OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,6,Fin the northwest. Elsewhere, largely
OL,7,Fdry and sunny. Warm in Scotland and
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland, but very warm to hot
OL,9,Facross much of England and Wales, with
OL,10,Flocally very hot conditions in the
OL,11,Fwest and southwest.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudier remains in the
OL,14,Fnorthwest with some patchy rain. Dry
OL,15,Felsewhere with long clear spells. Warm
OL,16,Fto very warm across parts of central
OL,17,Fand southern areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
