OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FVery warm becoming hot or
OL,6,Fvery hot across much of England and
OL,7,FWales. Chance of an isolated evening
OL,8,Fshower in the northeast. Heavier
OL,9,Fshowers for Northern Ireland and
OL,10,FScotland later.
